 "comment": [
  "The items RUN_IMG3D.bat makes by default, and what post.py needs per item. Ids and names: tools/item_dossier on",
  "the install (2026-11-16 run): 16 Matchbox, 15 Lamp, 21 Key (the brass key of the candle niche), 17 Book, 1 Shards",
  "and Seals, 4 Statuette (the four lying in the Study), 24 / 25 / 26 Mask, 9 Colt-45, 51 Colt-45 magazine.",
  "metres: the longest side of the real object where a dossier gives it (roth_held.cpp kRealSize: Lamp 30 cm tall,",
  "Matchbox 5.5 cm, Book 20 cm, Key 6 cm); null = not known: the engine sizes the lying item to its picture and the",
  "held one to its card (0.10 m). The Colt's 0.216 m is the M1911's length (reasoning only, not from the game).",
  "hold: palm (lies in the open palm), fist (held in the fist, up along the thumb), hang (hangs from the hand,",
  "upright). grip_frac: the grip point as fractions of the model's box (x left->right, y bottom->top, z back->front);",
  "grip_offset: metres added (palm: -0.025 puts the base 2.5 cm out of the palm from the grip socket).",
  "grip_rot: degrees (yaw about +Y, pitch about +X, roll about +Z). front_yaw: degrees about +Y applied to the",
  "generated mesh before anything else, if the generator's front is not +Z for this item. fill_holes: the film's",
  "ground mask cuts dark glass out as holes (the Lamp); true makes every hole the border cannot reach part of the",
  "item again (extract.py). All TUNING NUMBERS:",
  "nothing here was seen in a headset.",
  "default_items (2026-11-23): every item obtainable in chapters 1 and 2 (tools/item_dossier on STUDY1, STUDY3, MAS3, MAS4, MAS6, MAS7, MAUSO1EA/EB, AELF, ANUBIS) except the Colt and its magazine (own mesh), the Shotgun 38 and the Gun 54 (real meshes to be found), category-4 papers (letters, notes, maps: made another way), cards and creatures. The Shield 28's view: img3d_work/28/choose.txt film_017.tga (straight on; the most-pixels frame made a wedge).",
  "2026-11-23 sizes (owner: the chapter 1-2 batch came out 10 cm each): metres set by JUDGEMENT of the real object, not from the game (reasoning only, nothing seen in a headset): Shards 12 cm, Shrive 25, Orb 8, Keys 8, Masks 22-25, Staff 33 30 (the film shows a sceptre's proportions), Crystals 12 / 6 / 5, Jewel 6, Helm 30, Cartridges 12, Chalice 18, Vials 12 / 10, Coin 3.5. The Shield (worn on the off forearm: its fit there comes first) and the long weapons (Staff 12, Aelf's Dagger, Sword, Eternity, Wand) keep the picture size until their hilts and grips are set. post.py --resize sizes models already made.",
  "film: film_build.py's recipe (the gems and the glass the generator cannot make): see film_build.py's header."
